# zero's two values, from server-create-backup-key.yml on 2026-11-18 (hosts/three/leap/README.md
# § Before the stick): zero's tailnet address, and /root/.ssh/mirror-backup.pub, whose
# fingerprint is SHA256:CjbPiNyKKzvTZb60xObBkwgjLWbpH6CSyq+rqXUCBI0. A new key or address
# for zero means a new line here, then a new stick or an install-system-file on three.
